Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `value` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/ownership/generic_method_trait_and_function_value_calls_share_place_access.jet:5:17
    |
  5 |     both(value, value)
    |                 ^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through a write parameter, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass `value` only once, or copy first with `value.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
